  "details": "# Issue:\n\nRight now the \"Fade Out Microphone Icon When Inactive\" toggle is in the Audi & Voice Category of the Main Menu Settings. Putting it there is a bit weird to me as all the other settings regarding the HUD are in the User Interface Category, such as the Mic Opacity or Mic Toggle Volume.\n\n# Suggestion:\n\nMove the \"Fade Out Microphone Icon When Inactive\" toggle into the User Interface Category directly below the Mic Toggle Volume, as putting it there makes more sense.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nThe first picture shows the current placement of the \"Fade Out Microphone Icon When Inactive\" toggle and the second picture shown the other Mic Icon related settings:",
